cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Visual-Text Agentic Reasoning for Documents"
abstract: >-
  An agentic retrieval-augmented generation system for manufacturing equipment
  documentation. A recursive planning agent decomposes a technician's question
  into bounded reasoning steps, executes retrieval tools over a local corpus of
  equipment manuals, and exposes its full decision trajectory as an interactive
  reasoning tree. Retrieval is two-stage (FAISS recall followed by cross-encoder
  reranking), and answers pass through a self-critique stage that removes claims
  unsupported by the retrieved context. The system runs fully offline against
  local language models.
type: software
